 Date Figure Model TMP151077PS Art Studio Temporary Workers Hourly-intermittent temporary position available in the Oberlin College Art Department. Possibility of reappointment based on budget, department needs, and job performance.The Studio Art Program is continually building a pool of persons interested in temporary hourly-intermittent/on-call employment as an Artists’ Figure Model to work fall and spring semesters. All body types and experience leve... View Details Bookmark Cleveland Student Shuttle Driver TMP151071PS Major Events Program Temporary Workers Oberlin College and Conservatory is proud to introduce a Cleveland shuttle for students! The shuttle would take students, on Thursday-Sunday, to various locations throughout the Greater Cleveland Area. Locations include Crocker Park, University Circle, and more! Multiple drivers will be selected and will sign for shifts as their schedule allows. The shuttle is a 22-passenger transit vehicle. View Details Bookmark Administrative Assistant - Temp Pool TMP151038PS Human Resources Temporary Workers Oberlin College is recruiting temporary administrative assistants for the administrative temp pool.The administrative assistants work assignments with varying lengths of time in any office within the College and may experience periods of time in wait for the next assignment.If you enjoy a challenge and want to provide support to different areas on our beautiful campus, this is something that mi... View Details Bookmark Office of Human Resources Oberlin College 173 West Lorain Street Oberlin OH 44074 http://new.oberlin.edu/office/human-resources/ Phone: (440) 775-8430 Fax: (440) 775-8683 Hours: M-F 8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. human.resources@oberlin.edu 2015 © Oberlin College | Privacy Policy To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
